# Only what the Dockerfile copies from the build context is sent to the builder:
# conf/ and the a2enmod-family scripts. Everything else (the git history, the
# docs, the workflows, scripts/check-upstream.sh) stays out, so it can neither
# bloat the context nor end up in a layer by accident.
*
!conf/
!scripts/a2enmod
!scripts/a2dismod
!scripts/a2enconf
!scripts/a2disconf
!scripts/moddeps.sh
